#: charmy.widgets.widget.WidgetProfile:1 of
msgid "Class to store configs of a specific widget under a specific state."
msgstr ""

#: charmy.widgets.widget.WidgetProfile:3 of
msgid ""
"Each `WidgetProfile` represents a profile for `Widget`. Further, "
"`ButtonProfile` for  `Button`, `TextProfile` for `Text`, and so on. An "
"instance of `WidgetProfile` or its subclasses  comes with default values "
"for such type of widget. These default values will be affected by  "
"themes."
msgstr ""

#: charmy.widgets.widget.WidgetProfile:8 of
msgid ""
"Each `WidgetProfile` may have a `base_profile`, which explicitly "
"specifies which profile should  the one being created base on and "
"fallback to, and overrides the internal fallback routine. If  "
"`base_profile` is set to `profile_fallback_widget_state(state: str)` "
"mark, Charmy will use the  specified state profile of the current widget "
"as base profile."
msgstr ""

#: charmy.widgets.widget.WidgetProfile.default:1 of
msgid "To generate a profile with full default values for this widget."
msgstr ""

